G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"EVqumzu_CSGws7XMTCl5og","review_id":"NmK8KWiisomidZQ-q6aYFQ","date":"2013-06-30T04:18:29","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.956524670124054,"text_excerpt":"Tried Sukho Thai for the first time tonight. Can't believe I've been missing such a great place so close to home! We had the green curry with chicken (medium spice) and the fried rice with shrimp (mild-medium spice) - and enjoyed both dishes very much. The servers were a little harried due to short staffing, but they were friendly and apologetic and we didn't mind. A bit of server confusion (we ordered drunken noodles with shrimp and got the rice instead) - but we decided just to go with it. The food was good enough that we'll go back and try the drunken noodles again...probably next month! (FYI: there doesn't seem to be alcohol service here, which is odd for a Nola restaurant. We weren't..."},{"business_id":"EVqumzu_CSGws7XMTCl5og","review_id":"BuG3wONKzL2EwtJrPdU5Vg","date":"2012-07-29T21:48:31","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9416770935058594,"text_excerpt":"Sukho Thai is a little bit out-of-the-way for me, but I purchased a Groupon and I love Thai food, so it was worth the trip from the Westbank. The service was good. Our waitress was boasting that she just made some Mango Iced Tea, so we ordered some... it was pretty refreshing, and of course, free refills (this became necessary later on). I took the warnings from my fellow Yelpers to heart and knew to order a heat level down from my usual. Typically I go with Hot, so I ordered Medium in my chicken & eggplant curry dish. Towards the end, my eyes were actually watering. It was good, but I honestly didn't expect that from *medium*. Thank god for the mango tea. Between the fresh rolls (served ..."},{"business_id":"EVqumzu_CSGws7XMTCl5og","review_id":"RjBlRazmN6KiCwPp1NIy3w","date":"2013-04-15T09:36:29","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9410037994384766,"text_excerpt":"(I noticed in one of the reviews that at least one reviewer, Haley S., claims Suhko Thai is running some kind of promotion for good reviews. I certify that I know nothing about this, and that my review is both genuine and unsolicited. I have been contributing to Yelp for quite some time, and you can check my other reviews to verify that I am not a \"paid\" reviewer. I value my integrity, and I always give the most fair review, based solely on my experience, and I always will. You can count on me for the truth, be it good or bad.) We found this restaurant while looking for vegetarian restaurants in or near the French Quarter. This one really caught our eyes because they not only advertise \"v..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"EVqumzu_CSGws7XMTCl5og","photo_id":"cHWkdH6dAm0f9Gcq6wDTXg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/cHWkdH6dAm0f9Gcq6wDTXg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9225749373435974},{"business_id":"EVqumzu_CSGws7XMTCl5og","photo_id":"tvZD3KS_L7PnFAg9xuR-_Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/tvZD3KS_L7PnFAg9xuR-_Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8976139426231384},{"business_id":"EVqumzu_CSGws7XMTCl5og","photo_id":"ooN-caeMhygxth-WOz0iAg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ooN-caeMhygxth-WOz0iAg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8901979923248291},{"business_id":"EVqumzu_CSGws7XMTCl5og","photo_id":"fUOt3hzZZEq-VNlxM5aXTg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/fUOt3hzZZEq-VNlxM5aXTg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8777319192886353},{"business_id":"EVqumzu_CSGws7XMTCl5og","photo_id":"kz5mMJXzl-iel4i5uNDx5Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/kz5mMJXzl-iel4i5uNDx5Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8671017289161682}]},"notebook_case":null}
